== handover.sh again, with the released v0.2.0, while that change was only in dev
== 4/5 Release each variant, stage by stage: promote, approve, publish
cert-manager: every variant is released
homer-dashboard: every variant is released
Failed: HTTP 400 for req ...: unit metrics-server: the targets are at different revisions of it (2, 3); upgrade them to the same revision or narrow the spaces the change order is headed for
exit 1
-- It stopped before step 5, so the hub was not touched. v0.2.0 opened its own
-- change order on a base whose change was part way through its stages. v0.2.1
-- skips a component whose variants all have a release, and still re-checks
-- argo-cd, whose base step 3 changes.

